# THE COMPOSED LAYERS THAT DO OWE THE DEMAND SUM EXACTLY. One row per fusion not suspended on
# either ground: their filed demand must equal the sum of their converted parts, less the
# demand eliminations they filed.
#
# ⛔⛔ THE `quantity` COLUMN READS `demand` AND THAT IS A DECLARATION, NOT DECORATION. This
#    relation answers one quantity's question, because composition/suspended_fusions.sqlc is
#    per-quantity and this file chooses which grain it wants. ⭐ It reads the SET rather than
#    composition/suspension_grounds.sqlc, and the `EXCEPT` would have been immune either way --
#    which is exactly how a bag goes unnoticed for revisions. Take the whole suspension set with
#    no such choice and that is correct only while demand is the only sum anybody computes. A
#    nameplate sibling filters the same union on `'nameplate'`, and the point of the column is
#    that whoever writes it cannot forget to.
#
# ⭐⭐ AN ANTI-JOIN IS A FILTER, AND THIS ONE IS THE FILTER THE WHOLE COMPOSITION ARGUMENT
#    TURNS ON. `x_composed = F Φ x_parts − e` is not a law of the model; it is an obligation
#    a document takes on by saying it looked. This relation is the set of documents that took
#    it on, so it is the honest denominator for every claim that the composition rule holds.
#
# ⭐⭐⭐ AND IT IS WRITTEN AS `EXCEPT`, WHICH IS WHAT IT ALWAYS MEANT. The line below said
#    "pm.part MINUS the two suspensions" while the SQL underneath it was a LEFT JOIN with a
#    NULL test -- an idiom that names the left operand and buries the right one inside an ON
#    clause. `EXCEPT` names both, in the order the sentence reads, and the set difference is
#    exact here because both arms are the bare key: fusions is already `SELECT DISTINCT`, and
#    EXCEPT deduplicates.
#
# ⛔ THIS IS NOT A GENERAL SUBSTITUTION FOR THE ANTI-JOIN. `composition/leaves.sqlc` projects
#   `d.*` and carries the left row's payload through, which EXCEPT cannot do: it compares whole
#   rows and returns only what both arms can spell. Key-only difference is the case that
#   converts, and there are three of them in this tree.
#
# ⚠️ AN EMPTY OR SHORT RESULT IS NOT EVIDENCE HERE ON ITS OWN. `EXCEPT` shares precedence with
#   `UNION` in Postgres and associates left, so a missing pair of parentheses returns the wrong
#   set rather than an error, and a wrong set of composed layers is a perfectly ordinary table.
#   ⭐ THE LAW IS RECOMPUTED RATHER THAN RECORDED. algebra/owed_equality.sqlc asserts
#   |A| = |A∖B| + |A⋉B| over these operands on every run, so a number written here would be a
#   number nobody recounts. Read it there.
-- composition/fusions.sqlc minus the suspensions that lift the demand sum.
SELECT f.filing, f.layer, 'demand' AS quantity
FROM (
    :compose(composition/fusions.sqlc)
) f
EXCEPT
SELECT s.composition, s.composed_layer, 'demand'
FROM (
    :compose(composition/suspended_fusions.sqlc)
) s
WHERE s.quantity IS NULL OR s.quantity = 'demand'
